  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;DENIS MERVILLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Denis Merville is a French politician known for his work as an 'agriculteurs sur moyenne exploitation' and his commitment to the common farmer."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRENCH NATIONAL INSTITUTE FOR AGRICULTURAL RESEARCH (INRA)&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"INRA provides data on the agricultural sector, highlighting the importance of medium-sized farms."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NORMANDY FARMERS' ASSOCIATION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Normandy Farmers' Association praises Merville's dedication to the agricultural community."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PIERRE DUPONT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pierre Dupont is the president of the Normandy Farmers' Association and speaks highly of Merville's understanding of the agricultural trade."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;NATIONAL ASSEMBLY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Merville serves in the National Assembly, advocating for the rights of French farmers."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FARM-TO-TABLE PROGRAM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Merville's proposed initiative aims to increase the market share of locally sourced produce in French supermarkets."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LYON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Lyon is the town where Merville has retired and enjoys a more relaxed lifestyle."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RHÔNE RIVER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The Rhône River is a landmark in Lyon where Merville often walks and enjoys his retirement."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;POST OFFICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Merville collects his pension from the local post office, marking a significant change in his daily routine."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COZY APARTMENT&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Merville's cozy apartment in Lyon is a symbol of his comfortable retirement."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GARDEN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Merville's garden, filled with prized roses, is a key part of his new life after retirement."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MEDIUM-SIZED FARMS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Medium-sized farms like Merville's account for nearly 40% of France's agricultural production."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;CLIMATE CHANGE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Climate change poses challenges to the agricultural sector."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TRADE AGREEMENTS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Trade agreements affect the agricultural sector."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;COMMON FARMER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ROLE"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Common farmers are the focus of Merville's commitment and policies."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AGRICULTURAL COMMUNITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The agricultural community includes farmers and agricultural workers."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PARLIAMENTARY DEBATES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Parliamentary debates are part of Merville's previous political responsibilities."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PUBLIC SERVICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Public service is Merville's previous career before retirement."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PENSION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pension is a financial benefit Merville receives after retirement."&lt;SEP&gt;"Pension refers to a financial benefit that has transformed into a symbol of honor and dedication."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ROSES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Roses are a specific type of plant grown in Merville's garden."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LOCAL PRODUCE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Local produce is the focus of Merville's 'Farm-to-Table' program."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FRENCH SUPERMARKETS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"French supermarkets are the target market for Merville's 'Farm-to-Table' program."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;YOUNG POLITICIANS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GROUP"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Young politicians are a group of individuals seeking guidance and wisdom from a former statesman."&lt;SEP&gt;"Young politicians seek advice from Merville, recognizing his experience and wisdom."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;SERVING THE PEOPLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Serving the people is Merville's motivation for his political and agricultural work."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LAND&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Land is a crucial resource in agriculture and farming."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PEOPLE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"GROUP"</data>
      <data key="d1">"People are the beneficiaries of Merville's policies and initiatives."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AGRICULTURAL PRODUCTION&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Agricultural production is the output of farms and agricultural operations."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AGRICULTURAL POLICY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Agricultural policy is the framework within which Merville works to support farmers."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PUBLIC DUTY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Public duty refers to Merville's responsibilities as a politician and farmer."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;HARVEST SEASON&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Harvest season is a critical period for farmers and agricultural operations."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GROUP OF YOUNG POLITICIANS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The group of young politicians is a collection of individuals seeking advice and wisdom from a former statesman."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;FORMER STATESMAN&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The former statesman is a respected individual who served in office and now shares his wisdom with younger politicians."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DENIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Denis is the former statesman who is sharing his stories and wisdom with the young politicians, feeling proud of his legacy."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;OFFICE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Office represents the place where Denis served and held his position as a statesman."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;WISDOM&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Wisdom is the knowledge and experience shared by the former statesman with the young politicians."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LEGACY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Legacy is the pride and sense of accomplishment felt by Denis, knowing his work continues to inspire others."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PRIDE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EMOTION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Pride is the emotion felt by Denis, knowing his legacy continues to inspire a new generation of leaders."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0490</data>
    </node>
